                <li><a href="https://youtu.be/kN_TlfFifqA">Korean subtitles</a></li>
                <p><img align="center" alt="" border="0" src="//www.jma.go.jp/jma/en/common/maru_purple.gif" /> <strong> <!--<a href="tsunami_warning_video.html">-->Tsunami Warnings and Tsunami Advisories<!--</a>--></strong> (9 min.) </p><span class="new">Attention: </span>These videos are currently unavailable on this page.<br /> Contact details for inquiries:<br /> <!--Attention: Part of these videos are copyrighted by a third party. Contact details for inquiries:<br />--> 　Office of International Affairs<br /> 　Japan Meteorological Agency<br /> 　Phone: +81-3-3584-8603<br /> 　E-mail:<img alt="E-mail address" src="mail_address.png" style="vertical-align: text-bottom" /><br /> </div>
